# https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/atributo/CDV
<https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/atributo/CDV> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
