<https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/dominio/MDF/-1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/ValorDominio> .
