<https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/dominio/TAT/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/dominio/TAT/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/ValorDominio> .
<https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/dominio/TAT/1> <https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/esValorDeDominioDe> <https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/atributo/TAT> .
<https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/dominio/TAT/1> <https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/codigoValorDominio> "1" .
<https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/dominio/TAT/1> <https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/observacionFuente> "Alojamientos categorizados como Hotel, Hotel Boutique y Apart Hotel."@es .
<https://cdg-idera.github.io/ontologias/catalogo-objetos/dominio/TAT/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Alojamiento turístico hotelero"@es .
